The Abettor's song grants all affected party members +70% to all thieving skills, passive trap detection, Blur, a +3 bonus to Armor Class, a +1 bonus to all Saving Throws, and Non-Detection. The Abettor also gains Improved Invisibility for one round with each song pulse. All affected party members become invisible for one round when the song begins and for one round when the song ends. This is ordinary Invisibility and ends if the recipient attacks or casts a spell.

This ability replaces the current Bard Song.~

